{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/kAo_fOb3caXwSy2TAKJytw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:44.858296+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/kAo_fOb3caXwSy2TAKJytw","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/2dLZMpJIuzsjC99Km7so06ic87A5vlL7ian5Zf9gcP2QgowyN5xNVPSEawIFfVGJxicxG3dNsSmrmUuwMFe7HlCuVHqSeU9o5SXkWes5l5dsz4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2dLZMpJIuzuMjGYRZC9FdbAh8via4vZiby1Ux40lkjrgPXmWf0hnARBuLHCqIPdn9jZt7WwXsVaz4foEr3JpjmsW4ficIcdF70yNSzrs6RmAGk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>点击蓝字 关注我们</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2dLZMpJIuztx8es1UKaicXDvo3ttL0mv6O1y2CicQOh0kTRfFOe020SWkdKct5TUDVuibOz0UcrVqYJzFXy9cHuKgZ7oofMSN5WYWlRzdF1Sicg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/2dLZMpJIuzuxbrB6J6WLCEZKwX4JaDfo6nJNj5XOR7rbvhNb3OdFgFAvuxSWnx3EibY1SCkub719mvcwiaicAa8bv8mvP2PnFs9HoibglCBGN4Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>按照教育部有关工作要求，江苏大学临床医学与医学检验学院现正式启动2026年推荐免试研究生（含直博生，以下简称推免生）接收工作，热忱欢迎全国各高校优秀应届本科毕业生选择我院，踏上医学前沿探索的崭新征程！</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2dLZMpJIuzuC7SuhljhG122Xgqj3icZSL3FJmeaofCfLUmFC2SvNrtsp12lMtL9Wqza7gZyKGypzlqJS4Zf74UhRJoz4WETMCurhfA7icicdjQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报考指南</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2dLZMpJIuzvXS8Nkyz9dxWib5Ib9K4HGllabhNBErRb7XyGCTwRiaMmC1LSfuTzcRwiaLum7TzdrRZV80Ktwax3jC3KaxwkibCNyF9YcO1szeMY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/2dLZMpJIuzv2aWiaz5XITJkw17w9q2uW6ibGZYNLtwKsEVpmicefSiamEr8yP2GG1EJ321sYliagfP2kzib4k6tB4NM1mmlHf1bwNCRkr8uSx1fpQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></p><p><span>2.纳入国家普通本科招生计划录取的应届毕业生，获得本科就读学校的推荐免试资格。</span></p><p><span>3.有良好的学术专长或培养潜质，有较强的创新意识和创新能力。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2dLZMpJIuztV4vKsrDfnyA35ORZFzicplOZic0jDOIvurqicoJn4lZkkqJICMqtno2HTy0VWOCLVxDWZWticFHFbrqllXHU9TwhmaicfoKqsE1Ts/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请专业</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2dLZMpJIuzsk0ktic4FSlWp7WeQok9UEpInsa8mklTg5eOVucbfsDwRfQKEFS407tyhMjCJOmiaRaELqibMxwlaZFO27eViaDv6By47ShlYH41M/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.所有全日制硕士研究生招生专业均可接收推免生，具体接收目录与要求，请登录教育部“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（简称“推免服务系统”，网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）查询。</span></p><p><span>2.我院</span><strong><span>临床医学学科博士点</span></strong><span>可接收优秀应届本科毕业生</span><strong><span>直接攻读博士学位（直博生）</span></strong><span>，欢迎符合条件的考生积极申报。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2dLZMpJIuzuB0GFKibb1EC72p4vjykvJicQb6GmU8HoxnSmBl7ibyAYg714xPpA7KC7Rg8lO3FUR0etiaKNRrOARKvPUibicueVqqteOUq1xgqFOA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>预报名及申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2dLZMpJIuzuia1L75rm1H8XCVCnZu79n41Cg7fe7maTJTzDUrFicWvlb7y4MyP37khvbcq4GtdXMWpwNAlZbUqLnRdSelV8wsfiaM55yDqKz6w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>（一）江苏大学“接收推荐免试研究生网上申请系统”预报名</span></strong></p><p><span>为做好推免生接收工作，我校通过“接收推荐免试研究生网上申请系统”开展推免生预报名工作。</span></p><p><span>1.9月1日至9月19日。考生可登录我校推免生预报名系统（网址：https://yjszsgl.ujs.edu.cn/zsgl/tmsgl/def</span></p><p><span>ault.aspx)，点击“申请报名编号”进行注册，注册成功后进入系统填报预报名信息。</span></p><p><span>2.9月21日前。各学院将安排复试，并按程序及时向考生反馈复试结果。</span></p><p><strong><span>特别说明：</span></strong><span>鉴于2027年硕士研究生招生专业目录尚在编制调整中，为便于考生提前申报，本次预报名系统中暂采用2026年硕士研究生招生专业目录。后续教育部“推免服务系统”中将采用2027年版本，如涉及招生专业调整，届时将由我院负责老师另行通知相关考生。</span></p><p><strong><span>（二）教育部“推免服务系统”正式报名及录取流程</span></strong></p><p><span>1.自</span><strong><span>2026年9月18日</span></strong><span>起，获得本科就读学校推免生资格的考生须登录“推免服务系统”进行注册。</span></p><p><span>2.自</span><strong><span>2026年9月21日</span></strong><span>起，“推免服务系统”正式开放志愿填报。考生须登录系统填报“江苏大学”志愿，未通过该系统完成的申请一律无效。</span></p><p><span>3.教育部“推免服务系统”开通后，申请人应按照我校要求，在规定时间内完成志愿填报、接收复试通知、接收待录取通知等操作。</span></p><p><span>4.学校通过教育部“推免服务系统”及时向考生发出复试通知，</span><strong><span>考生需在收到通知后12小时内在“推免服务系统”中确认“复试通知”。</span></strong></p><p><span>5.学校通过教育部“推免服务系统”向考生发出待录取通知，</span><strong><span>考生需在收到通知后12小时内在“推免服务系统”中确认“待录取”通知。</span></strong></p><p><span>6.</span><strong><span>10月24日前，</span></strong><span>我校研究生招生办公室对外统一公示待录取名单，公示7日无异议后报教育部审批。2027年6月中下旬向正式录取考生发放录取通知书。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2dLZMpJIuzs9JlbSG7KQfXkc20WAJ5UP9PRrqbHomcUCNFXSPvHKY3fic1UUmmJ0fT19W4LOWA2wNsWpxib6hpa3bBkDeCzX6DcYlaswZNK0I/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>政策支持</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/2dLZMpJIuzvmtuuDo3pcl3kQXqiaiadt3WFI94LicVqtP76aJfJFpiaIEARscQsW6gZPJicc1NdbTk05cTicR19lfxwsyjsgzhTGOk2SKLl5UE0Hk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>为鼓励优秀推免生报考，凡报考我校的推免生可享受以下政策支持：</span></p><p><span>1.报考我校的推免生可自由选择攻读专业。</span></p><p><span>2.鼓励推免生选择报考五年制直博生，入学后即享受博士生奖助待遇。</span></p><p><span>3.学校设立“江苏省研究生科研实践创新计划”培育专项，对本校报考本校的推免生，优先进行资助。</span></p><p><span>4.推免生新生可优先选择优秀导师，优先申请硕博连读。</span></p><p><span>5.参加我校复试的推免生免缴考试费。</span></p><p><span>我院在学校政策允许范围内可制定具体优惠措施，如有疑问，请直接联系我院咨询。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2dLZMpJIuztXIppJXsZJibDIFSaNEoKOp1DmorzzBoujSJwmp4ia5gh5Sx1fYic5h0GmVYfkkwkHgPr8s7jWw5YUp6RCWOB9DI4iaT7g9Ba5WT0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>奖助激励</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2dLZMpJIuzvm272WstFg1X9Ugsib53VJB51FuefXoNISazJ1CcR8W8MojrdF1NKg1xCbH3bqztzVicREfFnHAiaGAlezIRwGz7SUCFtkck5E94/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>我校接收的推免生，在校学习期间可享受国家助学金（博士13500元/生/年，硕士6000 元/生/年），可按规定申请国家奖学金（博士30000元/生/年，硕士20000元/生/年）、学业奖学金（学业奖学金覆盖面 100%，博士最高至18000元，硕士最高至12000元）、“三助 ”津贴（助研/助教/助管）等。</span></p><p><span>研究生奖助体系的具体内容请参照《江苏大学研究生学业奖学金评审实施细则》、《江苏大学研究生国家助学金管理实施细则》、《江苏大学研究生国家奖学金评审实施细则》等文件。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/2dLZMpJIuzurTJ8YVahAwRBPVhsN7qqI9I8lPVJAEib4ON0ZVlQBcib5iaYuRcnY451NG0u2sYPHyYoFV7epsK9NFtdH5EMrfQS8hs0zWibzhBE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他事项</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2dLZMpJIuzsj1AERLdia5eCgtibFugSuibRhNTsIVZia8czBNgiaBoRohLQbOebbqxA9tKaia8tuNVUWFYGbBsZVN9JWrHmt8xXhx4X5eDd1HmEibc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.被我校接收的申请人在入学前未取得学士学位或受到处分，将取消其录取资格。</span></p><p><span>2.未尽事宜，学校将通过江苏大学研究生招生信息网（https://yz.ujs.edu.cn/）对外发布。如有疑问，可联系我院招生负责老师作进一步了解。</span></p><p><span>联系人：曹老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：0511-86102036</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>来源：江苏大学研究生招生办公室</span></p><p><span>编辑：顾晏恺 戴语嫣</span></p><p><span>审核：陈立勇 万妍</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"2b385616fa93f4a7afc81177620262c8fd458a67c3ad5422d0f660e626cd976f","textLength":1771,"sourceSha256":"b7891e8745aa84c25588adef2631dc75c0b8b3fb0284dc79692038289f90e154","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-26faa732b52d46a240bc","title":"2026年江苏大学临床医学与医学检验学院开始接收2027年推荐免试研究生","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:44.858296+00:00"}
